WEBVTT

00:08:57.036 --> 00:09:00.236
It's called a PDQeX,

00:09:00.276 --> 00:09:04.156
which stands for
"Pretty Damn Quick Extraction."

00:09:04.196 --> 00:09:06.236
(Laughter)

00:09:06.276 --> 00:09:07.396
I know.

00:09:07.756 --> 00:09:10.276
My friend Joe is really cool.

00:09:11.396 --> 00:09:14.756
One of the biggest challenges
in doing a DNA extraction

00:09:14.756 --> 00:09:18.076
is it usually requires
very expensive equipment,

00:09:18.116 --> 00:09:19.516
and takes hours.

00:09:19.556 --> 00:09:21.036
But with this machine,

00:09:21.076 --> 00:09:23.796
we've been able to do it in 20 minutes,

00:09:23.836 --> 00:09:25.076
at a fraction of the cost.

00:09:25.116 --> 00:09:27.996
And this runs off of a motorcycle battery.

00:09:29.156 --> 00:09:34.316
From there, we take the DNA extraction
and prepare it into a library,